  "updated_at": "2026-11-10T14:30:48Z",
  "body": "Hi! Could you please assign this issue to me? I'd like to work on fixing it and adding a regression test for reading cached `Blob` responses back from `TransferState`.\n\nSince `Blob.prototype.arrayBuffer()` is asynchronous while `transferCacheInterceptorFn` currently caches synchronously inside `tap()`, I'd also appreciate any preference on the approach (e.g., converting `Blob` bodies asynchronously via `concatMap` during `ngServerMode` and optionally preserving `blob.type` in `TransferHttpResponse`) before I open a PR.",
