  "updated_at": "2026-11-10T15:28:23Z",
  "body": "Blob caching, as I understand it, will not be covered because we can´t derive a complete cache key for them synchronously, so collisions can occur without the user being aware of them.\n\nThat's why, in https://github.com/angular/angular/pull/70227, we are updating the documentation to explain this.",
