  "updated_at": "2026-11-10T15:58:07Z",
  "body": " \nYou are right , my bad.  \n\n> preserving Blob bytes and type via body.arrayBuffer() during ngServerMode\n\nJust for context, I tried this before in #67002, and it was reverted in #67439. To read the Blob with `arrayBuffer()`, that PR made the server side of the transfer cache async, which changed the current sync behavior and broke tests like the `httpResource` one from #67307. So it couldn't land that way, and blob responses stayed unfixed.\n\n",
