  "created_at": "2026-11-10T16:04:41Z",
  "updated_at": "2026-11-10T16:04:41Z",
  "body": "Thanks for the context on #67002 / #67439, @SkyZeroZx — that's super helpful to know!\n\nLooking at #67002, it passed an `async` callback directly to `concatMap(async (event) => ...)`, which turned **every** response (`json`, `text`, `arraybuffer`, etc.) into a `Promise` and broke synchronous `httpResource` / `hydration_spec` / `transfer_cache_spec` tests.\n\nIn my local fix, I avoided that by keeping the synchronous path via `of(event)` for all non-`Blob` responses and only returning `from(body.arrayBuffer())` when `responseType === 'blob' && body instanceof Blob`. With that change, all existing `httpResource`, `transfer_cache_spec`, `hydration_spec`, and `platform-server` tests continue to run synchronously and pass unmodified.\n\nHappy to wait for @JeanMeche / the team's go-ahead and assignment before opening the PR!",
  "author_association": "NONE",
  "pin": null,
