  "updated_at": "2026-11-10T20:31:11Z",
  "body": "I think the most practical path forward right now is to remove the broken blob caching (skipping responseType === 'blob' in HttpTransferCache) and associated test. That means probably just updating #70227 to skip blob as well. \n\nAs for a fix forward to actually make blob work with SSR, we should hold off until there is community feedback indicating it's something we should do. ",
