  "created_at": "2026-11-11T20:51:56Z",
  "updated_at": "2026-11-11T20:51:56Z",
  "body": "> I think the most practical path forward right now is to remove the broken blob caching (skipping responseType === 'blob' in HttpTransferCache) and associated test. That means probably just updating #70227 to skip blob as well.\n\nI just added a new commit to #70227 that skips `responseType: 'blob'` in `HttpTransferCache`, so these requests just go to the network on the client instead of hydrating an empty Blob.\n\nAlso we can leave this issue open to continue to collect feedback",
