  "updated_at": "2026-11-12T04:35:39Z",
  "body": "Makes complete sense — skipping `responseType: 'blob'` in #70227 avoids the silent 0-byte corruption cleanly, and keeping this issue open to gauge demand for full SSR `Blob` caching sounds good to me. Happy to pick it back up if the team decides to support it later!",
